### disposable

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"type disposable_switch t =\n    {\n        Gleam : $'Nil'\n        Fsharp : $'System.IDisposable'\n        Python : $'object'\n        Rust : $'Rc<dyn Fn()>'\n        TypeScript : $'() => void'\n    }\nnominal disposable t = $'backend_switch `(disposable_switch t)'","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  type disposable_switch t =
      {
          Gleam : $'Nil'
          Fsharp : $'System.IDisposable'
          Python : $'object'
          Rust : $'Rc<dyn Fn()>'
          TypeScript : $'() => void'
      }
  nominal disposable t = $'backend_switch `(disposable_switch t)'
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### dispose

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl dispose (disposable : disposable _) : () =\n    backend_switch {\n        Gleam = fun () => $'// common.dispose' : ()\n        Lua = fun () => $'-- common.dispose' : ()\n        Fsharp = fun () => disposable |> $'_.Dispose()' : ()\n        Python = fun () => $'!disposable.__exit__(None, None, None)' : ()\n        Rust = fun () => $'(!disposable)()' : ()\n        TypeScript = fun () => $'(!disposable)()' : ()\n    }","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl dispose (disposable : disposable _) : () =
      backend_switch {
          Gleam = fun () => $'// common.dispose' : ()
          Lua = fun () => $'-- common.dispose' : ()
          Fsharp = fun () => disposable |> $'_.Dispose()' : ()
          Python = fun () => $'!disposable.__exit__(None, None, None)' : ()
          Rust = fun () => $'(!disposable)()' : ()
          TypeScript = fun () => $'(!disposable)()' : ()
      }
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

